{
  "project": {
    "name": "Dirndl",
    "slug": "dirndl",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "The traditional Alpine (Bavarian/Austrian) dress: a fitted bodice waist-seamed to a full gathered skirt, worn with a separate tied apron. This cartridge drafts the garment geometry — bodice, gathered skirt, and apron — and marks (does not reproduce) the regional trims, lacing, and apron decoration. A soft-goods garment — no hardware. FC-200 long-tail (heritage). Offered with respect for the living tradition.\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "El vestido tradicional alpino (bávaro/austríaco): un corpiño ajustado unido en la cintura a una falda amplia fruncida, con un delantal atado por separado. Este cartucho traza la geometría de la prenda — corpiño, falda fruncida y delantal — y marca (no reproduce) los adornos regionales, el cordón y la decoración del delantal. Una prenda textil — sin herrajes. Cola larga FC-200 (patrimonio). Ofrecido con respeto por la tradición viva.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "La robe traditionnelle alpine (bavaroise/autrichienne) : un corsage ajusté monté à la couture de taille sur une jupe ample froncée, portée avec un tablier noué séparé. Cette cartouche trace la géométrie du vêtement — corsage, jupe froncée et tablier — et marque (ne reproduit pas) les garnitures, le laçage et la décoration de tablier régionaux. Un vêtement textile — sans quincaillerie. Longue traîne FC-200 (patrimoine). Proposé dans le respect de la tradition vivante.\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "tags": [
      "dirndl",
      "heritage",
      "alpine",
      "dress",
      "bodice",
      "gathered",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
    {
      "id": "set",
      "label": {
        "en": "Full Dress",
        "es": "Vestido completo",
        "fr": "Robe complète"
      },
      "script_file": "main.py",
      "pieces": [
        "bodice_front",
        "bodice_back",
        "skirt",
        "apron"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pieces": [
    {
      "id": "bodice_front",
      "label": {
        "en": "Bodice Front",
        "es": "Corpiño frente",
        "fr": "Corsage devant"
      },
      "default_color": "#7a5a3a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "bodice_back",
      "label": {
        "en": "Bodice Back",
        "es": "Corpiño espalda",
        "fr": "Corsage dos"
      },
      "default_color": "#7a5a3a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "skirt",
      "label": {
        "en": "Skirt",
        "es": "Falda",
        "fr": "Jupe"
      },
      "default_color": "#6a4a2a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "apron",
      "label": {
        "en": "Apron",
        "es": "Delantal",
        "fr": "Tablier"
      },
      "default_color": "#8a6a4a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameter_groups": [
    {
      "id": "body",
      "label": {
        "en": "Body Measurements",
        "es": "Medidas Corporales",
        "fr": "Mesures du corps"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fit",
      "label": {
        "en": "Fit & Style",
        "es": "Ajuste y Estilo",
        "fr": "Coupe et style"
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "bust_girth",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "body",
      "default": 920,
      "min": 700,
      "max": 1400,
      "step": 10,
      "measurement": {
        "standard": "iso_8559",
        "code": "chest_bust_girth"
      },
      "label": {
        "en": "Bust girth (mm)",
        "es": "Contorno de busto (mm)",
        "fr": "Tour de buste (mm)"
      },
      "tooltip": {
        "en": "Full bust",
        "es": "Busto completo",
        "fr": "Tour de poitrine complet"
      }
    },
    {
